{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>一名台灣女子涉嫌在日本，殺死另一名台灣女子被捕。</p><p></p><p>案發於山梨縣富士河口町，日本傳媒報道，一名30多歲台灣女遊客，周一早上被發現伏屍在一間酒店房內，身上有刀傷。</p><p></p><p>警方到場發現一名27歲台灣女子，她持有一把長約12厘米的刀，警方將她拘捕，並調查她與死者關係。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T15:00:41.078978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:09.067490+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T14:58:45.772486+00:00","content_hash":"2338678c0663ca199cae43f05b5fff5d4a9b0897d629d90dfaa347fdb3e2e494","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}